---
// Footer.astro
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8">
      <!-- Col 1: About -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-4">
          <img
            src="/logo.png"
            alt="机场clash Logo"
            class="w-8 h-8 object-contain"
          />
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">机场clash</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-indigo-600 font-mono font-medium">jichang-clash.xyz</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          机场clash 是专注于全球优质机场测速、稳定性追踪与 Clash 系列客户端配置教程的评测站点。致力于为科研工作者、外贸从业者与跨境出海人员提供真实客观的选购参考。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">快速导航</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/recommendations" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">🔥 热门机场推荐</a></li>
          <li><a href="/comparison" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">📊 机场横向对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">📖 Clash 教程中心</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">💡 常见问题解答</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">🗺️ 网站地图 (Sitemap)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Disclaimer -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">免责声明</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          本站所有测速与教程内容均整理自公开网络技术资料，仅供外贸商务、科研学术查阅与网络性能研究之用。请严格遵守所在国家与地区的法律法规，文明合规使用网络。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 gap-4">
      <div>
        © {year} <a href="https://jichang-clash.xyz" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors font-medium">机场clash (jichang-clash.xyz)</a>. All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div class="flex space-x-4 text-slate-400">
        <span>高速专线</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>流媒体解锁</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>全平台配置</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
